// **Sleeps through daylight and works the dark without noticing.**
//
// The rota is the system this exists for. `SetShift` has been in the
// game since M4 and most towers never touch it, because putting
// somebody on nights is a straight loss — they sleep while the tower
// walks and the day crew carry the same load with one fewer pair of
// hands. Somebody who rests *better* off-shift is the first reason to
// open the roster and move a name.
//
// Expressed as bed rest rather than as a work bonus on purpose: this
// person is not better at their job, they are cheaper to house.
TraitDef(
    id: "trait.nocturnal",
    name: "Nocturnal",
    blurb: "sleeps through daylight, and does not mind the dark",
    // Rests as well on bare deck as most people do in a bed, which
    // quietly hands the tower a bunk back.
    deck_rest_pct: 200,
)
